{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["A journey of seven days — because Jacob was traveling slowly on account of his flocks, and Laban, who was at a distance from him — he had gone to shear his flocks, as it is written: ״וישם דרך שלשת ימים בינו ובין יעקב״ — so he hurried to pursue and overtook him at the end of seven days."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:53.568464376Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}